      {
        "name": "places/ChIJl5C8HQDxAzQRSjpakYApSAA/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25CWGVGQnpSVkYyUVZoVGMxOVVZM1ZLVlhWSkxWRRAB",
        "relativePublishTimeDescription": "6 個月前",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": {
          "text": "好有水準嘅一餐！🥳\n今日嚟到呢度開飯食lunch，點咗角切魚生飯，同埋蘑菇湯。個湯嚟到嘅時候熱辣辣，個湯勁有菜味好濃，唔求其。之後個角切魚生飯好好味，魚生飯上邊嘅醬料同埋吞拿魚蓉好，好，好食！！！（好食到我忍唔住\n成碗飯食晒😆)，一啖魚生+一啖飯😍 YumYummy !想講埋連個海蜇小碟都醃得好好食👍🏼整體係一絲不苟🈵我埋單嘅時候都忍唔住同服務員讚咗一下👍🏼\n大滿足的一餐🥰\n\nWhat a high-quality meal! 🥳\nCame here for lunch today and ordered the Assorted Diced Sashimi with Rice with Mushroom Soup. The soup arrived piping hot, packed with rich, intense vegetable flavour — definitely not made carelessly. The Cubed Sashimi Rice Bowl was absolutely delicious! The special sauce on top and the tuna mince were so good — I couldn’t stop eating! 😆 Ended up finishing the entire bowl (one bite of sashimi + one bite of rice = pure happiness 😍 YumYummy!).\nEven the small side dish of marinated jellyfish was perfectly seasoned 👍🏼 Overall, everything was done with great care and attention to detail. When I paid the bill, I couldn’t help but praise the staff 👍🏼\nSuper satisfying meal 🥰 Highly recommended!",
          "languageCode": "zh-Hant"
        },
        "originalText": {
          "text": "好有水準嘅一餐！🥳\n今日嚟到呢度開飯食lunch，點咗角切魚生飯，同埋蘑菇湯。個湯嚟到嘅時候熱辣辣，個湯勁有菜味好濃，唔求其。之後個角切魚生飯好好味，魚生飯上邊嘅醬料同埋吞拿魚蓉好，好，好食！！！（好食到我忍唔住\n成碗飯食晒😆)，一啖魚生+一啖飯😍 YumYummy !想講埋連個海蜇小碟都醃得好好食👍🏼整體係一絲不苟🈵我埋單嘅時候都忍唔住同服務員讚咗一下👍🏼\n大滿足的一餐🥰\n\nWhat a high-quality meal! 🥳\nCame here for lunch today and ordered the Assorted Diced Sashimi with Rice with Mushroom Soup. The soup arrived piping hot, packed with rich, intense vegetable flavour — definitely not made carelessly. The Cubed Sashimi Rice Bowl was absolutely delicious! The special sauce on top and the tuna mince were so good — I couldn’t stop eating! 😆 Ended up finishing the entire bowl (one bite of sashimi + one bite of rice = pure happiness 😍 YumYummy!).\nEven the small side dish of marinated jellyfish was perfectly seasoned 👍🏼 Overall, everything was done with great care and attention to detail. When I paid the bill, I couldn’t help but praise the staff 👍🏼\nSuper satisfying meal 🥰 Highly recommended!",
